is Sufi credentials were bolstered through his patronage of the Naqshbandi order, centred in Bukhara, and his cultivation of the Sufi shaykhs of Mawarannahr and Khorasan, who enjoyed a prominent position in his court" <br>However, "Temur could just as easily pose as protector of the Shi\'a tradition.<br>"The five daily prayers were a regular feature of life at Temur\'s court. Wherever he campaigned, with him went the imams and the royal mosque, a sumptuously appointed pavilion made of the finest silk."<br>'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 953, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 734})
