as to be led by the Caliph as the amir al-muminin (Commander of the Faithful), assisted by his wazirai (advisers), alkalai (judges), a muhtasib (the officer charged upholding morals), the sa\'i (in charge of the markets), the wali al-shurta (police chief), limamai, and military commanders.” '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 955, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 839})
